      "img": "modules/cyberpunk-5e/assets/weapon_icons/firearm_icons/rocket_launcher.png",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Ranged Weapon Attack: +7 to hit, range 120/480 ft., one target. Hit: 10 (3d6) piercing damage and 10 (3d6) thunder damage. This weapon has the heavy, reload (1, action), two-handed, strength 13 properties.</p><p><strong>Explosion.</strong> When the rocketman hits a creature or object with this weapon, the rocket explodes. Each other creature within 10 feet of the target must succeed on a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw or take half as much damage as the target took. Full cover between the target and a creature protects that creature from the explosion.</p><p><strong>Demolition.</strong> The rocket launcher deals double damage to objects, vehicles, and structures, including damage from the explosion. This doubling is applied before comparing the damage to a vehicle's damage threshold.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
